     {"question": "What's the difference between requireAdmin and adminActionClient?", "answer": "requireAdmin() is for server components and data loaders - it redirects unauthorized users to a 403 page. adminActionClient is for server actions - it returns an error response instead of redirecting, which is appropriate for API-style calls."},
